#. module: l10n_be_reports
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_be_reports/controllers/main.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"                        Access error: Only the accounting firm can submit "
"the VAT return to Intervat via the API.\n"
"                        To submit it yourself, download the XML file and "
"upload it on Intervat.\n"
"                        If you no longer have an accounting firm, remove it "
"from the Intervat setting to enable API submission.\n"
"                    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                        Toegangsprobleem: Alleen het accountantskantoor kan "
"de btw-aangifte via de API indienen bij Intervat.\n"
"Om deze zelf in te dienen, download je het XML-bestand en upload je het op "
"Intervat.\n"
"Als je geen accountantskantoor meer hebt, verwijder je dit uit de Intervat-"
"instellingen om API-indiening mogelijk te maken.\n"
"                    "

#. module: l10n_be_reports
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_be_reports/controllers/main.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"                        Access error: You do not have permission to give "
"consent for company %s. If you are an accounting firm,\n"
"                        make sure the Accounting firm field is set in the "
"Intervat settings. Otherwise, only the client can submit the VAT return "
"through API.\n"
"                    "
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_be_reports
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_be_reports/models/account_return.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        Once your accounting year is closed, it's time to "
"think about corporate income tax (ISOC).<br/>\n"
"                        Here's the key info in 4 simple steps:\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <ol>\n"
"                        <li>Year-end = the countdown starts. You have 7 "
"months to file your ISOC return via <a href=\"https://finances.belgium.be/fr/"
"E-services/biztax\" target=\"new\">Biztax</a>.</li>\n"
"                        <li>Your profit is taxed at 20% or 25%, depending on "
"your company's status and the amount of profit.</li>\n"
"                        <li>Any advance tax payments (prepayments) you've "
"made will be automatically deducted from the total tax due.</li>\n"
"                        <li>Overpaid? You get a refund. Underpaid? You'll "
"need to pay the balance (and possibly a surcharge).</li>\n"
"                    </ol>\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                    <p> \n"
"                        Zodra je boekjaar is afgesloten, is het tijd om na "
"te denken over de vennootschapsbelasting.<br/>\n"
"                        Hier volgt de belangrijkste informatie in 4 "
"eenvoudige stappen:\n"
"                   </p>\n"
"                    <ol> \n"
"                       <li> Jaareinde = het aftellen begint. Je hebt 7 "
"maanden de tijd om je aangifte vennootschapsbelasting in te dienen via <a "
"href=\"https://finances.belgium.be/fr/E-services/biztax\" "
"target=\"new\">Biztax</a>.</li>\n"
"                        <li>Je winst wordt belast tegen 20% of 25%, "
"afhankelijk van de status van je bedrijf en de hoogte van de winst.</li>\n"
"                        <li>Eventuele voorafbetalingen die je hebt gedaan, "
"worden automatisch in mindering gebracht op het totale verschuldigde "
"belastingbedrag.</li>\n"
"                        <li>Te veel betaald? Je krijgt een terugbetaling. Te "
"weinig betaald? Je moet het verschil bijbetalen (en mogelijk een toeslag).</"
"li>\n"
"                    </ol>\n"
"                "

#. module: l10n_be_reports
